# The SNMP agent as a management API: the VRFs it runs in. MAXSIZE is always printed when the agent
# is configured and keeps one row when it runs nowhere. With no community or user, EOS prints only
# "SNMP agent disabled: ...": DISABLED keeps a row then too, so the recipe can say enabled: no.
Value VRFS (.+?)
Value MAXSIZE (\d+)
Value DISABLED (\S.*?)

Start
  ^SNMP agent disabled:\s+${DISABLED}\s*$$
  ^SNMP agent enabled in VRFs:\s+${VRFS}\s*$$
  ^Transmit message maximum size:\s+${MAXSIZE}\s*$$
